{"id":"3333ce5067a93fe7","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-embedding-rules.md","title":"df-embedding-rules","display":"df-embedding-rules","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-embedding-rules","aliases":["56-df-embedding-rules"],"display":"df-embedding-rules","depends_on":["[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","[[56-df-terms]]"],"source_section":"6.3.2","source_pages":"200","source_ocr_blocks":[221],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-embedding-rules"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-embedding-rules</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embedding-rules"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5e02461ce48023cc\" href=\"?note=5e02461ce48023cc\" title=\"56-df-terms\">56-df-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"6.3.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"200"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>221</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 可数无限，固定互异变量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_i)_{i\\ge1}\">\\((x_i)_{i\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。这里 embedding rules 指直接删除一个函数根、保留某个参数的规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)&amp;:=\\{(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),x_i)\\mid\nf\\in F,\\;n=\\mathrm{ar}(f),\\;i\\in[n]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V))&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)&amp;:=\\{(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),x_i)\\mid\nf\\in F,\\;n=\\mathrm{ar}(f),\\;i\\in[n]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V))&amp;.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Definition 6.3.2。为每个函数符号选择固定变元代表；所有替换实例仍由改写关系自动生成。常元不产生规则。Emb 的改写步可删除项树中的函数节点；原书用它刻画简单终止和调用 Kruskal 树嵌入性质。不要把单步 Emb 改写与其自反传递闭包混为同一关系。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003；6.3.2，印刷页 200。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 是本地 DjVu 文本提取块序号，不是已确认的物理扫描页号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-terms","status":"resolved","id":"5e02461ce48023cc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-terms]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"(x_i)_{i\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)&:=\\{(f(x_1,\\ldots,x_n),x_i)\\mid\nf\\in F,\\;n=\\mathrm{ar}(f),\\;i\\in[n]\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V))&.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1433,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-embedding-rules.md]]"},{"id":"ac167a6d94ee8495","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Proposition 6.3.15(ii)。假设无限下降序列，替换稳定和子项性质先排除下降中新出现的变量；因此该序列只用有限多个变量，将这些变量视作额外常元后签名仍有限。[[56-thm-finite-signature-tree-embedding]] 中已内建的 Kruskal 嵌入结论给出 $i<j$ 使 $t_j\\to_{\\mathrm{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)}^*t_i$，即较早项 $t_i$ 嵌入较晚项 $t_j$；嵌入规则见 [[56-df-embedding-rules]]。子项性质和上下文封闭性给出 $t_j=t_i$ 或 $t_j\\,Q\\,t_i$，而原下降给出 $t_i\\,Q\\,t_j$，与严格序的不可反性、传递性矛盾。输入文件记录了 p.204 的历史证明核验；本修订把其中使用的有限签名、有限变量嵌入断言补为直接内部依赖。保留有限签名前提，不能只因每个项有限而删除它。"},{"id":"5683a9cab2c7d87a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"工作于 ZFC。$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$ 为 [[56-df-terms]] 的签名，$|F|<\\aleph_0$；$V$ 为可数无限且与 $F$ 不交的变量集，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。给定 $X\\subseteq V$ 且 $|X|<\\aleph_0$；$\\operatorname{Var}$ 见 [[56-df-variables]]。令 $E=\\operatorname{Emb}(\\Sigma,V)$，其规则取 [[56-df-embedding-rules]]；$\\operatorname{Red}$ 见 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]。下式 $P^*$ 是 [[56-df-relation-closure]] 在载体 $T$ 上的自反传递闭包；序列的索引从 $0$ 开始。"}],"outgoing":["a6c29a8d098ef0ed","5e02461ce48023cc"]}